Terminal Layout
Terminal 1 (Backend Server): * Directory: kluff/server

Command: npm run dev

Status: Running on port 5000 with MongoDB connected.

Terminal 2 (Tunnel to Internet) — RUN HERE:

Directory: Anywhere in your project (kluff)

Command: lt --port 5000

Status: Generates your public HTTPS URL (e.g., https://funny-cats-swim.loca.lt).

